              ":answer/value": "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a7d5ee7e-b991-5ced-9c2d-3aa1dded6ce8",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{7 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{7 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "cf5fcef1-23d1-5d78-b4ce-cabfadcfc4e8",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)"
            },
