              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- 4 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- 4 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(x\\right)"
            },
            {
